cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Elliptic Regularity: a Lean 4 formalization of the regularity theory of divergence-form equations"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization, built on Mathlib, of the manuscript "Elliptic Regularity".
  It proves the manuscript's main results on scalar, second-order, divergence-form
  uniformly elliptic equations with measurable coefficients: the isoperimetric,
  Sobolev, Poincare, John-Nirenberg, Trudinger, Nash and trace inequalities;
  Almgren and Alt-Caffarelli-Friedman monotonicity; Schauder and
  Calderon-Zygmund estimates; the Meyers estimate and Gehring lemma; the
  De Giorgi-Nash-Moser Holder estimate and the Harnack inequality, with
  sharpness examples; Green function estimates; and the Nash-Aronson estimates
  for parabolic equations. Each main result is stated in a single file in the
  form given in the manuscript.
type: software
